abstract: >-
  MeaningFlux is an open-source workflow for machine-learning and
  information-theoretic analysis of post-processed eddy covariance data.
  It integrates data inspection, predictive modeling, an ML-to-information-
  theory bridge, and diagnostics of nonlinear dependence, information
  fidelity, lagged information transfer, redundancy, uniqueness, and synergy.
keywords:
  - eddy covariance
  - machine learning
  - information theory
  - mutual information
  - transfer entropy
  - environmental data analysis
  - scientific software

